WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 18]

01:37.679 --> 01:38.810
Isn't this the spring exam?

01:38.830 --> 01:40.540
Shouldn't they pass the exam
by their merit?

01:40.560 --> 01:42.880
These aren't just names.

01:43.440 --> 01:45.479
This is how
the bureaucratic world works.

01:51.519 --> 01:53.000
Fan Xian,

01:53.879 --> 01:55.290
the tallest tree in the forest

01:55.310 --> 01:57.160
is the first
to be blown down by the wind.

01:57.879 --> 01:59.639
It's important to be knowledgeable,

02:01.010 --> 02:03.320
but it's more important
to learn the way of life.

02:11.920 --> 02:13.759
You'll get used to it eventually.

02:23.279 --> 02:24.720
Have you met Guo Zheng?

02:26.119 --> 02:27.379
Mr. Lin, you know that as well?

02:27.399 --> 02:30.759
Guo Zheng was
the censor-in-chief before this.

02:31.160 --> 02:33.120
But he became the interim
Minister of Rites

02:33.320 --> 02:35.740
after Guo Youzi was imprisoned.

02:35.760 --> 02:38.720
The spring exam is filled
with all kinds of taboos.

02:38.800 --> 02:40.580
You have to learn more from him.

02:40.600 --> 02:42.580
I've only met him once. However...

02:42.600 --> 02:44.039
However,

02:44.119 --> 02:45.959
you two don't get along well.

02:46.119 --> 02:48.559
Mr. Lin, Guo Zheng's renovation
of the examination hall...

02:48.559 --> 02:50.140
It was in accordance with the rules.

02:50.160 --> 02:52.959
He's been an official
for many years after all.

02:53.320 --> 02:54.799
He knows them inside out.

02:55.480 --> 02:58.840
To use the rules to protect oneself,

02:59.559 --> 03:01.079
that's what you have to learn

03:01.239 --> 03:02.499
in the future.

03:02.519 --> 03:05.340
I know you feel uncomfortable about it.

03:05.360 --> 03:06.710
But just hang in there.

03:06.730 --> 03:08.880
Once you pass the trial,
which is the spring exam,

03:09.559 --> 03:13.479
you'll have a bright future ahead.

03:24.030 --> 03:25.680
The Crown Prince went to see him?

03:25.800 --> 03:26.880
Have a seat.

03:27.959 --> 03:29.039
That's right.

03:29.800 --> 03:31.939
After that, Fan Xian went
to Prime Minister Lin's residence.

03:31.959 --> 03:33.799
He rushed there to say hi to him?

03:34.360 --> 03:35.440
Your Highness,

03:35.880 --> 03:37.539
we have several names here as well.

03:37.559 --> 03:39.359
Why don't we send it to him?

03:40.160 --> 03:41.219
Not this year.

03:41.239 --> 03:43.239
But all these scholars are loyal to you.

03:44.510 --> 03:46.239
This year, it depends on their luck.

03:46.760 --> 03:48.340
I've already set up the trap.

03:48.360 --> 03:50.519
I can't just fall for it myself.

03:51.239 --> 03:52.259
Say,

03:52.279 --> 03:53.170
do you think Fan Xian

03:53.190 --> 03:55.940
will proceed with the spring exam
in accordance with the past rules?

03:56.030 --> 03:57.900
The rules had been established
many years ago.

03:57.920 --> 03:59.600
No one can break them.

04:05.559 --> 04:06.799
He's different.

04:08.839 --> 04:10.460
The things that people are used to,

04:10.480 --> 04:12.160
he might not be used to them.

04:50.800 --> 04:51.880
Wang.

04:52.480 --> 04:53.560
Yes, Mr. Fan.

04:53.639 --> 04:56.320
When I first heard about
the spring exam scandal,

04:57.999 --> 04:59.719
I actually thought of

05:01.559 --> 05:03.920
eradicating the corrupt system

05:04.160 --> 05:06.680
and upholding justice
for all scholars in the world.

05:06.960 --> 05:10.639
Mr. Fan, you truly care about
the state and its people.

05:12.480 --> 05:14.159
It's only been a while,

05:15.640 --> 05:16.960
yet Crown Prince and Prime Minister Lin

05:16.960 --> 05:19.279
already sent their name lists to me.

05:22.439 --> 05:24.040
What can I do?

05:26.520 --> 05:28.120
If I wish to compete with Chengze,

05:28.840 --> 05:30.719
I need Crown Prince's support.

05:33.800 --> 05:36.040
For Prime Minister Lin,
it's way more obvious.

05:36.999 --> 05:38.679
I'll marry Wan'er after the spring exam.

05:38.679 --> 05:40.240
We'll be a family by then.

05:41.280 --> 05:43.880
I don't wish to take on their tasks,

05:44.319 --> 05:45.500
but I have no choice.

05:45.520 --> 05:47.179
Mr. Fan,

05:47.199 --> 05:49.639
you have no other choices here.

05:54.160 --> 05:56.199
Did you know
what Prime Minister Lin told me?

05:56.319 --> 05:57.519
What did he say?

06:00.400 --> 06:02.279
He said everyone was already used to it.

06:05.400 --> 06:06.920
He wanted me to bear with it.

06:10.720 --> 06:12.279
If I do bear with it,

06:13.960 --> 06:15.920
I'll get used to it in the future.

06:18.439 --> 06:19.960
Everyone is already
used to this practice.

06:19.960 --> 06:23.360
Why should I stand out
from the crowd right now?

06:25.480 --> 06:27.399
If I stand out right now,

06:28.770 --> 06:30.940
the entire imperial court
will see me as their enemy.

06:30.960 --> 06:32.560
And, a bloody storm will ensue.

06:40.119 --> 06:41.759
Why don't I just bear with it?

06:46.840 --> 06:48.159
Mr. Fan,

06:49.600 --> 06:51.279
you have a bright future ahead.

06:54.559 --> 06:56.380
Why must I be the one
to bear all the blame?

06:56.400 --> 06:58.040
Why must I be betrayed by my kin

06:58.040 --> 06:59.279
and live in hell?

06:59.480 --> 07:00.560
Wang,

07:00.720 --> 07:02.279
I'm just an ordinary person.

07:03.400 --> 07:04.739
I'm not that special.

07:04.759 --> 07:06.399
I'm not that brave either.

07:07.160 --> 07:09.000
I'm not that righteous either!

07:10.820 --> 07:12.000
Mr. Fan,

07:12.430 --> 07:14.599
I just hope
that you'll have a clear conscience.

07:15.600 --> 07:17.440
I have a clear conscience
from the start.

07:20.679 --> 07:22.619
I have a clear conscience
from the start!

07:22.639 --> 07:24.399
I'm not the one at fault here!

07:26.600 --> 07:27.680
Mr. Fan,

07:28.160 --> 07:30.680
no one is arguing with you.

07:45.960 --> 07:47.120
Mr. Fan.

07:48.800 --> 07:50.659
Shi Chanli and the rest
didn't do anything strange.

07:50.679 --> 07:51.759
You...

07:52.079 --> 07:53.159
Got it.

07:54.030 --> 07:55.680
I'm just here to check things out.

08:00.400 --> 08:02.040
Let Mr. Fan head there alone.

08:20.480 --> 08:21.560
Come.

08:21.639 --> 08:22.800
Come, let's eat.

08:22.820 --> 08:23.700
We can read after eating.

08:23.720 --> 08:25.040
Here, let's eat.

08:30.119 --> 08:31.199
Yang.

08:32.040 --> 08:33.120
You are?

08:33.959 --> 08:35.119
Fan?

08:38.160 --> 08:39.599
Yang, why don't you get a table?

08:40.359 --> 08:43.040
I brought my own food here.
I'm too shy to use their table.

08:43.200 --> 08:45.160
- What are you doing?
- I'm reading while eating to get a better appetite.

08:45.160 --> 08:46.960
Why aren't you reading inside the room?

08:47.479 --> 08:48.559
Fan,

08:48.920 --> 08:51.130
they charge us for the candles we use.

08:51.150 --> 08:52.640
I don't need any candles here.

08:54.230 --> 08:56.240
Yang, are you perhaps
in some sort of trouble?

08:57.000 --> 08:58.500
Fan, you're being too tactful here.

08:58.520 --> 08:59.680
I'm just penniless.

09:03.920 --> 09:05.000
Waiter.

09:05.599 --> 09:08.040
I want some roasted chicken,
beef, and some liquor.

09:08.439 --> 09:10.239
Sir, don't you want to get a table?

09:10.719 --> 09:11.980
A table?

09:12.000 --> 09:13.119
This place is fine.

09:13.679 --> 09:14.759
Okay.

09:27.559 --> 09:28.639
Fan,

09:28.920 --> 09:30.160
what are you...

09:30.359 --> 09:31.520
Fate led us to be acquaintances.

09:31.540 --> 09:32.839
We should drink to that.

09:33.559 --> 09:34.659
This won't do.

09:34.679 --> 09:36.760
You can buy me a meal in the future.

09:38.479 --> 09:39.680
No need for that.

09:40.559 --> 09:42.359
I have to thank you for the meal.

09:44.839 --> 09:46.280
Sirs.

09:47.370 --> 09:48.680
Please enjoy your meal.

09:54.640 --> 09:56.180
Sir, all of your dishes are here.

09:56.200 --> 09:57.220
Please enjoy them.

09:57.240 --> 09:58.320
Okay.

10:00.230 --> 10:01.659
Fan, sorry for the embarrassment.

10:01.679 --> 10:04.280
It's been too long since I had meat.
I can't hold it in anymore.

10:04.280 --> 10:05.459
That's normal.

10:05.479 --> 10:05.920
If so, I...

10:05.920 --> 10:07.170
Please help yourself.

10:14.120 --> 10:17.920
Yang, when we were in the exam hall,
you said you wanted to be an official.

10:17.960 --> 10:19.550
Why did we come
to the Capital in the first place?

10:19.550 --> 10:20.290
To become officials.

10:20.290 --> 10:21.419
If so, why are we working

10:21.439 --> 10:22.250
at the exam hall?

10:22.270 --> 10:23.680
To become officials too.

10:23.880 --> 10:24.580
Yes.

10:24.600 --> 10:26.020
I even dreamt
of becoming one in my dream.

10:26.040 --> 10:28.680
Are you doing it so that you can
bring honor to your family?

10:30.359 --> 10:31.439
No.

10:32.580 --> 10:34.430
It's because
I can't stand it any longer.

10:41.160 --> 10:43.140
Fan, the imperial examination is unfair.

10:43.160 --> 10:44.500
The officials are corrupt.

10:44.520 --> 10:45.839
Famine and death are everywhere.

10:45.839 --> 10:47.780
But here,
they're engaged in a faction war.

10:47.800 --> 10:49.550
Everyone in the world knows that fact.

10:49.719 --> 10:50.740
Even so,

10:50.760 --> 10:52.400
everyone keeps quiet.

10:53.359 --> 10:54.760
Hou wanted me to bear with it.

10:55.230 --> 10:56.060
But I thought to myself,

10:56.080 --> 10:57.939
if I could bear with
the unfairness of the world,

10:57.959 --> 11:00.680
the books I read would be nothing
but a pile of waste paper.

11:01.160 --> 11:02.359
Therefore, Fan,

11:03.120 --> 11:04.320
in this world,

11:04.479 --> 11:07.040
someone has to confront
the world head-on.

11:07.199 --> 11:08.020
You see,

11:08.040 --> 11:10.539
if I do pass the exam,

11:10.559 --> 11:12.599
I'll become more famous, right?

11:13.160 --> 11:14.659
I'll be more influential.

11:14.679 --> 11:16.680
More people will be able
to hear my voice.

11:19.599 --> 11:20.920
I wish to be an official

11:21.200 --> 11:23.240
because I don't wish
to bear with the situation.

11:33.040 --> 11:35.440
Yang, your vision as an official

11:36.839 --> 11:38.400
will lead you to a dead end.

11:41.280 --> 11:42.839
I know it's a dead end.

11:43.880 --> 11:45.079
But Fan,

11:45.640 --> 11:46.920
you see,

11:47.440 --> 11:48.680
I lost my mind from studying too much.

11:48.700 --> 11:49.900
I'll stick to my points no matter what.

11:49.900 --> 11:51.370
Sorry for the embarrassment.

11:54.520 --> 11:55.600
Yang.

12:19.820 --> 12:20.359
Mr. Fan.

12:20.370 --> 12:21.339
Deng, sorry for the trouble.

12:21.359 --> 12:23.220
Continue to keep an eye
on the inn in the next few days.

12:23.240 --> 12:24.459
You flatter me.

12:24.479 --> 12:25.599
It's my duty.

12:26.559 --> 12:27.059
Wang,

12:27.079 --> 12:28.140
let's go.

12:28.160 --> 12:30.450
- Are we returning home?
- To the Imperial Inspectorate.

12:31.880 --> 12:33.459
We're heading
to the Imperial Inspectorate now?

12:33.479 --> 12:35.270
I want to read the stone monument again.

12:35.520 --> 12:36.679
What did I say again?

12:36.679 --> 12:38.320
He always acts on a whim.

12:38.880 --> 12:40.320
I heard you again.

12:40.479 --> 12:41.819
What do you call this?

12:41.839 --> 12:42.819
We call this

12:42.839 --> 12:44.879
being deep in thought

12:45.079 --> 12:47.320
and wise as the vast ocean.

12:49.559 --> 12:51.560
Mr. Fan, you're amazing indeed.

12:52.120 --> 12:53.200
See you.

13:21.839 --> 13:24.299
Thinking of you makes one age,

13:24.319 --> 13:26.760
time has quickly passed.

13:27.280 --> 13:29.520
Let go and speak of it no more,

13:30.000 --> 13:32.119
strive to eat better.

13:51.559 --> 13:54.199
You're the one supervising
the anonymous transcription, right?

13:54.400 --> 13:57.500
By then, keep an eye out
for these names.

13:57.520 --> 13:59.839
These aren't just names.

14:00.439 --> 14:02.440
This is how
the bureaucratic world works.

14:02.520 --> 14:04.380
All those in this name list

14:04.400 --> 14:06.240
will be seen as failing participants.

14:06.240 --> 14:08.070
[Record of Spring Exam Hall Renovation]

14:09.400 --> 14:12.079
If I do pass the exam,

14:13.679 --> 14:15.760
I'll become more famous, right?

14:16.319 --> 14:17.819
I'll be more influential.

14:17.839 --> 14:19.839
More people will be able
to hear my voice.

14:24.520 --> 14:25.920
Actually, I also know

14:26.679 --> 14:28.400
that I can't pass the exam.

14:29.410 --> 14:31.700
All of the candidates
have been selected beforehand.

14:31.800 --> 14:33.440
People like us don't get a chance.

14:34.439 --> 14:36.079
I'm just a poor scholar.

14:36.359 --> 14:37.760
What can I do?

14:51.760 --> 14:53.239
Fan Xian, you see,

14:54.760 --> 14:57.839
they traveled hundreds of miles
to the Capital.

14:58.079 --> 14:59.939
To them, the spring exam is more than

14:59.959 --> 15:01.959
just an exam.

15:02.479 --> 15:04.520
It resembles hope.

15:05.599 --> 15:07.119
I love this quote.

15:09.400 --> 15:10.260
Get out of the way.

15:10.280 --> 15:11.599
You're blocking my view.

15:13.439 --> 15:15.459
They can't bear to pay for the candles,

15:15.479 --> 15:17.520
but they still wish to read in the dark.

15:23.640 --> 15:24.839
Thank you.

15:31.319 --> 15:33.359
When Mother was still alive,

15:34.559 --> 15:36.719
she wanted to change the world.

15:40.679 --> 15:42.599
It wasn't just the world.

15:42.719 --> 15:46.520
Your mother also said that she wanted
to change the people's hearts.

15:47.000 --> 15:48.520
Back then,

15:48.679 --> 15:51.160
she was like a shining meteor.

15:51.559 --> 15:54.939
She also resembled a blazing fire,

15:54.959 --> 15:58.119
showing the people of Qing
a different kind of light.

15:58.559 --> 16:00.040
But she still died.

16:00.240 --> 16:01.400
But,

16:01.479 --> 16:03.599
that light left some traces behind.

16:03.800 --> 16:05.040
Many people changed

16:05.240 --> 16:07.079
because of her.

16:08.120 --> 16:09.999
Sometimes, I often think about this.

16:10.920 --> 16:12.599
With Mother's ability,

16:13.599 --> 16:15.500
she would've led a great life too

16:15.520 --> 16:17.119
if she chose a different path.

16:17.679 --> 16:20.079
But she still shone
and left behind an epitaph.

16:20.880 --> 16:22.160
But now,

16:22.839 --> 16:24.800
not many people remember it.

16:27.700 --> 16:29.390
Say, did you think she regretted it?

16:29.800 --> 16:31.119
She'd never regret it.

16:31.439 --> 16:33.079
Until the last moments of her life?

16:33.280 --> 16:35.900
I didn't manage to see
the last moments of her life.

16:35.920 --> 16:37.299
But I believe

16:37.319 --> 16:39.479
that Ye Qingmei
never regretted her decision.

16:39.760 --> 16:41.040
Wasn't she afraid?

16:42.390 --> 16:44.500
She was only afraid
that the light she produced

16:44.599 --> 16:46.599
wasn't bright enough.

16:53.760 --> 16:55.179
I never expected

16:55.199 --> 16:56.359
to be the person

16:57.040 --> 16:58.879
passing on the torch one day.

17:00.870 --> 17:02.020
I wish to get into trouble.

17:02.040 --> 17:02.980
Sure.

17:03.000 --> 17:03.940
Go ahead.

17:03.960 --> 17:06.099
I'll bear all of the blame.

17:06.119 --> 17:08.159
I can't just make you
bear all of the blame.

17:09.480 --> 17:10.560
What blame?

17:10.800 --> 17:12.839
I have a better shield than you.

17:13.079 --> 17:15.500
There's someone else
who's a better shield than me?

17:15.520 --> 17:16.600
That's right.

17:17.480 --> 17:19.760
The best shield in the world.

17:32.919 --> 17:35.399
Did Fan Xian tell you
to relay the message to me?

17:36.720 --> 17:39.800
I was perplexed as well.

17:40.040 --> 17:41.619
All these years,

17:41.639 --> 17:45.040
I've never seen someone
who does things like Mr. Fan.

17:46.040 --> 17:47.819
What kind of message did he have for me?

17:47.839 --> 17:49.579
Your Majesty, he hopes

17:49.599 --> 17:51.560
that you can summon him to the palace.

17:53.840 --> 17:54.960
Summon him.

17:57.280 --> 17:58.439
Yes, Your Majesty.

18:24.120 --> 18:24.720
[Gong Dian]

18:24.720 --> 18:26.660
[Deputy Commander of the Imperial Guards]
Fan Xian?

18:37.960 --> 18:39.240
Mr. Fan!

18:42.680 --> 18:43.879
Commander Gong?

18:44.280 --> 18:45.480
Do you need anything?

18:46.800 --> 18:48.090
It's late now.

18:48.110 --> 18:49.520
What are you doing here?

18:49.760 --> 18:51.579
His Majesty summoned him.

18:51.599 --> 18:52.679
Right now?

18:53.190 --> 18:54.599
According to the rules,

18:54.760 --> 18:56.040
no officials

18:56.119 --> 18:57.919
shall enter the palace at this hour.

18:58.079 --> 19:01.760
His Majesty's edict is the rule.

19:02.839 --> 19:03.930
This is my duty.

19:03.950 --> 19:05.280
Sir, please forgive me.

19:18.240 --> 19:19.359
Your Majesty,

19:19.919 --> 19:21.520
Fan Xian has arrived.

19:21.919 --> 19:22.999
Now?

19:33.079 --> 19:34.099
Your Majesty,

19:34.119 --> 19:36.099
I heard that the gunpowder
you made blew up a few days ago.

19:36.119 --> 19:37.919
I felt worried, Your Majesty.

19:38.079 --> 19:40.800
That's why I made
some burn medicine for you.

19:40.879 --> 19:43.379
And, you worry about
national affairs every day.

19:43.399 --> 19:46.720
I've also prepared some tonics
that can help soothe the nerves.

19:46.760 --> 19:49.300
You can take it after dinner.

19:49.320 --> 19:51.760
As for the burn medicine,
it's for external applications.

19:53.000 --> 19:54.159
What else is there?

19:55.480 --> 19:56.560
That's all.

19:58.079 --> 20:00.240
You said you were worried about me, huh?

20:00.240 --> 20:02.180
Why do I feel like
you cannot be trusted?

20:02.200 --> 20:04.119
I've been injured for a few days now.

20:04.119 --> 20:06.159
But you're only here now.

20:06.240 --> 20:08.220
It took me some time
to make the medicine.

20:08.240 --> 20:09.320
Besides,

20:09.520 --> 20:11.720
you wanted me to summon you here.

20:12.919 --> 20:15.960
What's with the huge detour?
Who are you trying to show?

20:16.960 --> 20:19.500
Your Majesty, I can't
hide anything from you indeed.

20:19.520 --> 20:20.600
Enough already.

20:20.960 --> 20:22.740
Just cut to the chase.

20:22.760 --> 20:23.700
Your Majesty,

20:23.720 --> 20:25.879
do you trust me?

20:25.919 --> 20:28.119
Just say whatever you want to say.

20:28.839 --> 20:31.439
Your Majesty, do you know about
the spring exam corruption?

20:31.720 --> 20:33.619
Ever since I became the Middle Examiner,

20:33.639 --> 20:35.319
I've received plenty of notes every day.

20:35.319 --> 20:36.740
The notes are filled with names.

20:36.760 --> 20:38.099
And, these names

20:38.119 --> 20:39.539
were chosen beforehand

20:39.559 --> 20:41.879
so that they could pass the exam
without taking it.

20:42.159 --> 20:43.359
Continue.

20:43.639 --> 20:46.240
I hope to seek fairness

20:46.520 --> 20:47.879
for the spring exam.

20:48.240 --> 20:50.020
You want fairness?

20:50.040 --> 20:51.170
Why did you seek me, then?

20:51.190 --> 20:52.700
I'm afraid it'll implicate
too many things.

20:52.720 --> 20:54.500
I might not be able to handle it alone.

20:54.520 --> 20:55.793
In the entire Qing State,

20:55.813 --> 20:58.733
Your Majesty, you're the only one
who can block the blow for me.

21:05.766 --> 21:07.806
You want me

21:08.240 --> 21:09.700
to be your shield?

21:09.720 --> 21:10.960
Not my shield.

21:11.350 --> 21:12.879
It's the shield of Qing State.

21:16.480 --> 21:20.480
Why do you sound like Lai Mingcheng?

21:22.720 --> 21:24.119
Did you bear a grudge toward me

21:24.119 --> 21:27.079
for Lai Mingcheng's death?

21:28.760 --> 21:29.840
That's right.

21:29.919 --> 21:31.300
You shouldn't have done so.

21:31.320 --> 21:32.520
Yes, Your Majesty.

21:33.240 --> 21:35.159
You're pretty straightforward, huh?

21:40.919 --> 21:43.000
On account of your straightforwardness,

21:45.040 --> 21:46.879
I'll block the blow for you.

21:48.960 --> 21:50.099
Thank you, Your Majesty.

21:50.119 --> 21:51.960
If so, I shall take my leave first.

22:00.960 --> 22:02.040
Help me apply

22:02.680 --> 22:04.040
the medicine.

22:09.520 --> 22:11.480
His Majesty summoned Fan Xian
to the palace?

22:12.359 --> 22:13.210
At this hour?

22:13.230 --> 22:14.580
He'll never summon him
this late at night

22:14.599 --> 22:16.280
unless it's something important.

22:16.480 --> 22:17.859
Are you sure you're not mistaken?

22:17.879 --> 22:19.339
Gong Dian saw it himself.

22:19.359 --> 22:21.059
He thought something was off either.

22:21.079 --> 22:23.280
He relayed the news to us immediately.

22:26.183 --> 22:28.020
If so, do you know
what they talked about?

22:28.040 --> 22:30.359
Gong Dian said
even Eunuch Hou wasn't inside.

22:30.399 --> 22:31.740
Only His Majesty and Fan Xian

22:31.760 --> 22:33.439
knew about the conversation.

22:34.599 --> 22:36.760
Even Eunuch Hou wasn't inside, huh?

22:39.159 --> 22:40.239
All right now.

22:40.359 --> 22:42.119
Tell Gong Dian to stop.

22:42.440 --> 22:44.079
Do not let him continue.

22:45.079 --> 22:46.819
His identity is vital to our success.

22:46.839 --> 22:48.680
Do not relay any information to me again

22:49.359 --> 22:51.000
unless it's necessary.

22:51.450 --> 22:52.620
Yes, Your Highness.

22:53.919 --> 22:55.679
We just don't know what His Majesty

22:55.760 --> 22:57.720
said to Fan Xian.

23:04.919 --> 23:06.839
That doesn't matter.

23:07.639 --> 23:10.280
He summoned him late at night,
and he went there alone as well.

23:11.200 --> 23:13.200
Seems like His Majesty

23:15.919 --> 23:17.639
favors Fan Xian a little too much here.

23:27.119 --> 23:29.299
Your Highness, regarding this,

23:29.319 --> 23:30.819
I can't do it.

23:30.839 --> 23:32.679
Please forgive me.

23:35.720 --> 23:37.159
I heard that His Majesty

23:38.040 --> 23:39.679
summoned you last night.

23:40.319 --> 23:41.639
That did happen.

23:44.950 --> 23:46.919
If so, did His Majesty
tell you anything?

23:47.800 --> 23:49.079
His Majesty

23:49.240 --> 23:50.639
told me nothing.

23:52.119 --> 23:53.520
He told you nothing?

23:59.850 --> 24:02.030
If so, take it as if
this conversation never existed.

24:03.359 --> 24:05.220
Your Highness,
for the current spring exam,

24:05.240 --> 24:07.250
everyone should
depend on their abilities.

24:08.050 --> 24:09.639
That was supposed to be the case.

24:43.680 --> 24:44.960
Mr. Qin?

24:46.079 --> 24:47.359
Mr. Fan?

24:49.119 --> 24:50.059
I knew you would

24:50.079 --> 24:51.399
take this path.

24:51.520 --> 24:52.500
But why?

24:52.520 --> 24:53.899
Because you're afraid of people.

24:53.919 --> 24:55.900
That proves
that we have an affinity, right?

24:59.559 --> 25:00.260
Mr. Fan,

25:00.280 --> 25:01.610
when I was in the military,

25:01.630 --> 25:03.240
I owed these people some favors.

25:03.680 --> 25:05.240
Mr. Fan, I hope you can take care

25:05.399 --> 25:07.520
of these people here.

25:08.079 --> 25:09.159
Sorry about that.

25:09.520 --> 25:10.859
There aren't that many names here.

25:10.879 --> 25:13.240
Mr. Qin, please relay
this message to the others.

25:13.960 --> 25:14.579
What is it?

25:14.599 --> 25:16.880
For the spring exam,
only one's ability will be reviewed.

25:16.900 --> 25:19.350
I won't accept any name lists
no matter where they come from.

25:21.000 --> 25:23.480
Did His Majesty summon you last night

25:23.559 --> 25:25.079
for this very matter?

25:25.280 --> 25:27.200
His Majesty said nothing.

25:27.559 --> 25:29.240
Understood.

25:29.365 --> 25:31.966
He said nothing.
I didn't make any guesses today.

25:37.550 --> 25:39.920
[Fang Shenping, Li Qinglun,
Wen Chengjun, Huang Xiangzhong]

25:41.800 --> 25:44.379
Mr. Lin, I'm truly sorry.

25:44.399 --> 25:45.960
Regarding the spring exam,

25:46.280 --> 25:47.879
we still have to follow the rules.

25:49.280 --> 25:50.899
Why did you do so?

25:50.919 --> 25:52.960
I had no choice either.

25:56.159 --> 25:59.520
I know that His Majesty
summoned you last night.

26:02.359 --> 26:05.639
Now, everyone would think

26:06.000 --> 26:09.800
that His Majesty ordered you to do so.

26:11.000 --> 26:12.839
I understand His Majesty well.

26:13.440 --> 26:15.420
With the way he does things,

26:15.440 --> 26:18.139
it's either he acts swiftly

26:18.159 --> 26:20.839
to eradicate all corruption

26:22.440 --> 26:25.480
or he leaves subtle traces

26:25.919 --> 26:28.040
that stretch for miles.

26:29.079 --> 26:31.000
Even if everything falls into place,

26:31.240 --> 26:34.560
he won't let anyone
see through his thoughts.

26:35.520 --> 26:38.760
He would never summon someone
in the middle of the night

26:38.839 --> 26:40.679
and do something this lackluster.

26:42.680 --> 26:44.545
That's not the way he does things.

26:44.565 --> 26:48.085
You're just using His Majesty
as your shield.

26:53.319 --> 26:55.139
Mr. Lin, you do know him well.

26:55.159 --> 26:57.339
No one knows the real him.

26:57.359 --> 26:58.740
Of all the rulers in Qing State,

26:58.760 --> 27:01.698
he's the one
who's the toughest to figure out.

27:01.718 --> 27:02.837
Mr. Lin, you're too modest.

27:02.839 --> 27:04.720
Don't try to shift the topic. Answer me.

27:04.760 --> 27:06.320
Why did you do so?

27:11.800 --> 27:13.439
Actually, I just wanted

27:14.159 --> 27:15.839
the spring exam

27:16.280 --> 27:18.100
to be conducted according to the rules

27:18.520 --> 27:19.960
and be fair,

27:20.325 --> 27:21.605
even if it's just once.

27:22.559 --> 27:25.159
All of the officials have their eyes
on the spring exam.

27:25.399 --> 27:26.559
Aren't you afraid?

27:26.559 --> 27:27.750
I am.

27:27.770 --> 27:29.240
That's why I'm using
His Majesty as my shield.

27:29.240 --> 27:31.139
Didn't I tell you
that I already saw through it?

27:31.159 --> 27:32.520
What will you do

27:32.680 --> 27:34.180
if I expose you?

27:34.200 --> 27:35.980
Mr. Lin, we're a family.

27:36.000 --> 27:37.299
You have to spare me somehow.

27:37.319 --> 27:38.520
Why should I spare you?

27:38.530 --> 27:40.560
Because Wan'er only wants
to be married to me.

27:41.319 --> 27:43.660
At most,
I'll find another husband for her!

27:43.680 --> 27:44.720
Mr. Lin, you're right.

27:44.720 --> 27:46.399
Mr. Lin, please calm down.

27:46.639 --> 27:49.560
I really don't understand
if this is fate or calamity.

27:51.319 --> 27:53.679
Why did Wan'er
fall for someone like you?

27:54.919 --> 27:56.599
I'm pretty outstanding myself.

28:01.359 --> 28:03.800
You want the spring exam
to be fair for once?

28:04.319 --> 28:05.960
What are you after here?

28:06.960 --> 28:09.679
What's in it for you if you do so?

28:13.720 --> 28:15.919
Actually, Mr. Lin, I understood

28:16.520 --> 28:17.839
what you said last time.

28:20.680 --> 28:22.919
If one stands out from the crowd,
they'll be targeted.

28:23.800 --> 28:25.679
That's why I've also thought

28:26.399 --> 28:28.760
of drifting with the current
before this.

28:30.000 --> 28:31.439
There's nothing bad about it.

28:32.110 --> 28:34.439
If I can't tolerate something,
I should just bear with it.

28:35.200 --> 28:36.800
I'll get used to it eventually.

28:40.480 --> 28:41.960
But that doesn't work.

28:43.800 --> 28:45.320
I couldn't sleep at night.

28:46.319 --> 28:47.879
I experienced anguish.

28:50.079 --> 28:52.790
There are three words
that keep popping up in my mind.

28:52.810 --> 28:54.720
I couldn't get rid of it
no matter what I do.

28:54.760 --> 28:56.240
What words?

29:01.639 --> 29:03.040
That it's unfair.

29:59.050 --> 30:03.370
[The Way]

30:10.240 --> 30:11.919
Those are two words.

30:15.727 --> 30:18.247
The first word
should be counted as well.

30:19.720 --> 30:21.240
We're educated individuals.

30:21.520 --> 30:24.450
We should be cautious
with our choice of words.

30:24.470 --> 30:26.119
I'll surely take note of it next time.

30:28.200 --> 30:29.760
It's unfair?

30:30.319 --> 30:32.159
So it's because of that, huh?

30:36.040 --> 30:37.760
Say, do you think fairness

30:37.960 --> 30:39.460
actually exists in the world?

30:39.480 --> 30:40.720
Not absolutely,

30:40.760 --> 30:41.840
but relatively.

30:43.359 --> 30:44.439
What?

30:46.800 --> 30:49.059
This world has no absolute fairness.

30:49.079 --> 30:51.220
For example, some people are born

30:51.240 --> 30:52.500
with a silver spoon.

30:52.520 --> 30:53.940
Some are born penniless.

30:53.960 --> 30:55.420
Some are born witty

30:55.440 --> 30:56.980
while some appear foolish.

30:57.000 --> 30:58.139
The spring exam exists

30:58.159 --> 31:00.020
to provide everyone

31:00.040 --> 31:03.099
with a relatively fair chance
of changing their destinies.

31:03.119 --> 31:04.520
If their only chance

31:04.520 --> 31:05.800
isn't fair as well,

31:06.350 --> 31:08.620
don't you think
the world will be a ridiculous place?

31:22.919 --> 31:24.240
Fine.

31:25.919 --> 31:27.599
We'll let the Capital

31:28.520 --> 31:29.919
be fair for once.

31:44.159 --> 31:47.130
Go and meet Guo Zheng,
the Minister of Rites again.

31:47.150 --> 31:48.879
I've made the arrangement for you.

31:49.559 --> 31:51.300
Ask him to elaborate on

31:51.320 --> 31:53.140
the taboos and rules of the spring exam.

31:53.560 --> 31:55.420
Since you're trying
to pursue fairness for their sake,

31:55.440 --> 31:57.399
you shouldn't fall
for the trap yourself.

32:04.079 --> 32:05.200
Fan Xian,

32:06.639 --> 32:08.480
what if this world

32:08.879 --> 32:10.720
is a ridiculous place
in the first place?

32:11.800 --> 32:14.040
What should we do by then?

32:16.280 --> 32:17.766
There's no need to answer me.

32:17.840 --> 32:19.480
You may ask yourself that question.

32:20.720 --> 32:21.800
Go now.

32:31.480 --> 32:32.760
To be fair, huh?

32:58.599 --> 32:59.760
Mr. Fan.

33:01.240 --> 33:02.420
Mr. Guo?

33:02.440 --> 33:03.679
We meet again.

33:04.480 --> 33:06.839
Mr. Fan, I've been waiting for you.

33:08.639 --> 33:11.399
Mr. Guo, you're well-versed
in the rites and customs.

33:11.440 --> 33:12.599
I came here today

33:12.599 --> 33:13.760
to ask you about

33:13.760 --> 33:15.130
the rules related to the spring exam.

33:15.150 --> 33:16.790
Prime Minister Lin
already told me about it.

33:16.810 --> 33:18.870
Please don't say
that you're here to learn from me.

33:19.159 --> 33:21.539
Mr. Fan, you're very intelligent.

33:21.559 --> 33:24.819
Actually, you can
understand them yourself.

33:24.839 --> 33:27.280
I'm just here
to put the icing on the cake.

33:30.839 --> 33:32.200
I've prepared this long ago.

33:32.570 --> 33:35.200
[Detailed Rules of the Spring Exam]
Mr. Fan, a capable person like you have to do more.

33:35.200 --> 33:36.740
You have plenty of affairs to deal with

33:36.760 --> 33:38.299
during the spring exam.

33:38.319 --> 33:39.460
Before the exam,

33:39.480 --> 33:41.420
you have to inspect the candidates.

33:41.440 --> 33:42.299
During the spring exam,

33:42.319 --> 33:44.740
you have to monitor
and supervise the exam hall.

33:44.760 --> 33:48.579
After that, you need to supervise
the anonymous transcription as well.

33:48.599 --> 33:51.299
The spring exam is a huge deal.

33:51.319 --> 33:52.539
The rules and taboos

33:52.559 --> 33:53.539
are countless.

33:53.559 --> 33:55.700
I couldn't tell you
about all of them at once.

33:55.720 --> 33:57.560
Therefore, I wrote them down.

33:58.520 --> 34:00.780
All of the details and rules
are stated within.

34:00.800 --> 34:03.579
Mr. Fan, if you read it,

34:03.599 --> 34:07.359
you won't omit anything
during the spring exam.

34:08.039 --> 34:10.559
I have no way to repay your favor.

34:17.120 --> 34:17.700
Mr. Fan.

34:17.720 --> 34:18.800
What?

34:18.839 --> 34:20.479
Come here. Go over there.

34:22.280 --> 34:23.479
This pillar is...

34:26.999 --> 34:28.320
Make it straight.

34:30.039 --> 34:31.519
Mr. Guo.

34:32.839 --> 34:33.819
Mr. Sun.

34:33.839 --> 34:35.660
The spring exam is nearing. I'm busy.

34:35.680 --> 34:36.090
I'm busy.

34:36.110 --> 34:37.320
Please go ahead.

34:45.039 --> 34:46.999
Mr. Guo, it must've been tough.

34:49.760 --> 34:51.160
Thank you.

34:53.270 --> 34:54.959
Right now, I'm just looking forward

34:55.319 --> 34:58.299
to you establishing a school of thought
and publishing your own book.

34:58.319 --> 35:00.519
By then, I'll be content.

35:01.240 --> 35:03.720
If so, thank you, Mr. Guo.

35:03.999 --> 35:04.899
Farewell.

35:04.919 --> 35:06.559
Mr. Fan, take care.

35:20.039 --> 35:21.119
How did it go?

35:22.640 --> 35:24.680
Did you not hear us at the back?

35:25.720 --> 35:27.140
Fan Xian is extraordinary.

35:27.160 --> 35:28.130
I dared not

35:28.150 --> 35:30.299
eavesdrop on you two
as I was trying to be cautious.

35:30.319 --> 35:31.479
What a shame.

35:31.760 --> 35:33.060
You didn't see

35:33.080 --> 35:35.879
the expression on his face
when he was touched by my action.

35:36.039 --> 35:38.559
I almost couldn't bear to do it.

35:39.560 --> 35:41.899
What did you write
inside the manual you gave him?

35:41.919 --> 35:45.519
I wrote down all of the rules

35:45.680 --> 35:47.280
related to the spring exam.

35:47.399 --> 35:49.200
I cannot make intentional mistakes

35:49.280 --> 35:50.640
when it comes to writing.

35:52.270 --> 35:53.559
You did the right thing.

35:54.680 --> 35:56.160
Fan Xian

35:56.839 --> 35:58.039
is very cautious.

35:59.200 --> 36:00.290
However,

36:00.310 --> 36:02.379
for important events
like the spring exam,

36:02.399 --> 36:05.810
there are some rules
that shouldn't be stated.

36:05.830 --> 36:07.299
Since they're not supposed to be stated,

36:07.319 --> 36:09.600
naturally, I have to leave them blank.

36:10.080 --> 36:12.979
Mr. Xie, please relay
this message to His Highness.

36:12.999 --> 36:13.939
Since I'm here,

36:13.959 --> 36:15.100
I'll definitely make sure

36:15.120 --> 36:17.359
Mr. Fan commits all the taboos
during the spring exam.

36:17.359 --> 36:18.830
I dare not guarantee
that he'll commit a huge crime,

36:18.839 --> 36:22.760
but I'll make sure all of the scholars
stay away from him.

36:27.160 --> 36:30.240
Mr. Guo, aren't you afraid
that you'll offend Prime Minister Lin?

36:31.479 --> 36:33.320
I'm afraid.

36:37.640 --> 36:40.120
However, Prime Minister Lin

36:40.760 --> 36:42.680
doesn't have the goods on me.

36:43.680 --> 36:44.959
His Highness said

36:45.360 --> 36:47.710
those were just old
and discarded ledgers from the past.

36:47.830 --> 36:49.100
He'll visit you and thank you in person

36:49.120 --> 36:51.519
once his house arrest has been lifted.

36:52.560 --> 36:55.959
He'll burn
all of the useless ledgers as well.

36:58.830 --> 37:00.379
If so, please tell His Highness

37:00.399 --> 37:01.919
to enjoy the show.

37:12.300 --> 37:15.970
[Fan's Residence]

37:51.160 --> 37:51.980
Is he here?

37:52.000 --> 37:54.230
He's inside. I've made
the necessary arrangements.

37:54.359 --> 37:55.499
No one saw him, right?

37:55.519 --> 37:57.459
We avoided all the people
in the residence.

37:57.479 --> 37:58.660
Don't worry.

37:58.680 --> 38:00.120
No one saw us.

38:10.280 --> 38:12.080
He must be starving.

38:12.800 --> 38:13.880
You're back.

38:16.039 --> 38:17.119
Yes.

38:18.439 --> 38:19.460
This time,

38:19.480 --> 38:20.939
my return trip from Northern Qi

38:20.959 --> 38:23.379
was a perilous one indeed.

38:23.399 --> 38:26.500
Luckily, Guo and I
were the ultimate duo.

38:26.520 --> 38:27.499
No matter what happened,

38:27.519 --> 38:28.419
we overcame the obstacles

38:28.439 --> 38:29.660
and employed clever tactics.

38:29.680 --> 38:31.019
That's how we managed

38:31.039 --> 38:32.800
to return to the Capital in one piece.

38:32.919 --> 38:34.840
You two are close
to each other now, huh?

38:35.039 --> 38:37.479
Heroes cherish each other after all.

38:41.640 --> 38:42.419
Young Master,

38:42.439 --> 38:44.720
since you've returned
to your hometown gloriously,

38:44.720 --> 38:46.439
I have to prepare
a welcoming feast for you.

38:46.439 --> 38:47.660
Let's discuss the feast.

38:47.680 --> 38:48.299
It's my treat.

38:48.319 --> 38:48.999
No. It's my treat.

38:48.999 --> 38:49.700
It's my treat.

38:49.720 --> 38:50.419
It's my treat.

38:50.439 --> 38:50.919
Come, Wang.

38:50.919 --> 38:51.859
Young Master.

38:51.879 --> 38:53.640
You sound vigorous.

38:54.519 --> 38:55.680
What should we eat?

38:57.959 --> 38:59.039
It's my treat.

39:02.959 --> 39:04.680
This is my diary of infiltration.

39:05.760 --> 39:06.959
Thank you so much.

39:07.399 --> 39:08.399
He said you brought me here

39:08.399 --> 39:10.060
to save my father.

39:10.080 --> 39:11.280
Here's the thing.

39:11.359 --> 39:13.740
The spring exam is nearing,
and I'm the examiner.

39:13.760 --> 39:15.359
What has that got to do with me?

39:15.519 --> 39:17.700
I'm not very clear
about many of the taboos.

39:17.720 --> 39:18.640
Neither am I.

39:18.640 --> 39:20.959
But your father was once
the Minister of Rites.

39:21.999 --> 39:23.979
You want my father to help you out?

39:23.999 --> 39:25.439
That's why I brought you back.

39:25.680 --> 39:27.879
Your father can only
rest at ease when he sees you.

39:28.600 --> 39:30.819
You planned for the spring exam
that early on, huh?

39:30.839 --> 39:33.280
Actually, I was already preparing
my countermeasures

39:33.280 --> 39:35.339
when Chengze recommended me
to supervise the spring exam.

39:35.359 --> 39:37.339
Now, it seems like
it was the perfect timing.

39:37.359 --> 39:38.559
Each of you

39:39.440 --> 39:40.620
is more malicious than the next.

39:40.640 --> 39:41.979
It's called being meticulous.

39:41.999 --> 39:43.340
Enough. Tell me.

39:43.360 --> 39:44.999
How do you plan to rescue my father?

39:45.080 --> 39:45.760
I'll arrange for it.

39:45.760 --> 39:47.530
I'll transfer him
to the Imperial Inspectorate's cell

39:47.530 --> 39:48.090
in a few days.

39:48.110 --> 39:49.740
If so, will you still be able
to rescue him by then?

39:49.740 --> 39:52.160
I'm the inspector there.
What do you think?

39:56.240 --> 39:57.640
But there's one thing.

39:58.999 --> 40:01.939
The charges they press upon your father
for conspiring wasn't unfounded.

40:01.959 --> 40:03.419
I can guarantee his survival.

40:03.439 --> 40:05.020
However, there's no way

40:05.040 --> 40:06.559
he can be an official again.

40:07.566 --> 40:08.646
I know that.

40:09.319 --> 40:11.760
I'm already grateful
that you can guarantee his survival.

40:13.800 --> 40:15.060
I'll tell my father about it.

40:15.080 --> 40:16.700
I'll tell him to explain the rules

40:16.720 --> 40:19.399
and details of the spring exam to you.

40:23.640 --> 40:24.720
What is this?

40:24.999 --> 40:27.180
It's a manual written
by the current Minister of Rites.

40:27.200 --> 40:29.700
All of the taboos
of the spring exam are inside.

40:29.720 --> 40:31.039
If so, you don't need my father's help.

40:31.039 --> 40:32.459
Quite the opposite.

40:32.479 --> 40:34.919
I need your father
to review the manual for me.

40:39.319 --> 40:42.790
Are you afraid that this manual
might be a trap for you?

40:42.810 --> 40:43.979
I'm just being cautious here.

40:43.999 --> 40:45.000
Your father will determine

40:45.020 --> 40:46.399
whether it's a trap or not.

40:47.439 --> 40:48.090
All right.

40:48.110 --> 40:49.280
Let's go, then. Let's rescue my father.

40:49.280 --> 40:49.979
Let's go.

40:49.999 --> 40:51.160
There's no rush.

40:53.240 --> 40:54.320
Sizhe.

40:55.880 --> 40:57.120
Lower your volume.

40:58.392 --> 40:59.899
The trip was a long one.

40:59.919 --> 41:01.100
It must've been tough for you two.

41:01.120 --> 41:02.339
You all should rest for a few days.

41:02.359 --> 41:04.399
Remember,
don't let other people see you.

41:04.720 --> 41:05.879
Of course.

41:07.359 --> 41:08.600
I'm very cautious.

41:08.760 --> 41:10.200
If so, I can rest at ease, then.

41:10.760 --> 41:11.840
Come.

41:13.439 --> 41:14.800
Firstly,

41:15.200 --> 41:16.959
you two, welcome home.

41:25.359 --> 41:26.620
Isn't it embarrassing?

41:26.640 --> 41:28.220
Don't you think you two stink?

41:28.240 --> 41:31.240
Why don't you two take a bath? You stink.

41:31.399 --> 41:32.250
Do I stink?

41:32.270 --> 41:32.960
It's not that bad.

41:32.980 --> 41:34.100
Come. I'll scrub your back for you.

41:34.120 --> 41:34.979
Let's go.

41:34.999 --> 41:36.519
Let's hurry.

41:48.039 --> 41:49.959
Why aren't there any guards here?

41:50.640 --> 41:52.080
Isn't it obvious?

41:53.879 --> 41:55.830
This is the cell
inside the Ministry of Justice.

41:55.850 --> 41:57.540
Is this place
under your jurisdiction as well?

41:57.560 --> 41:59.600
There are still some things
I can do here.

42:00.600 --> 42:02.120
Since you're this capable,

42:02.120 --> 42:03.620
you shouldn't just
deliver his meals to him.

42:03.640 --> 42:05.100
You should rescue him today.

42:05.120 --> 42:06.200
Calm down.

42:06.319 --> 42:08.620
Everything will be easier
when the transfer is done.

42:08.640 --> 42:09.959
It'll only take a few days.

42:10.600 --> 42:13.039
Don't worry.
I won't lie to you this time.

42:14.120 --> 42:15.959
You already lied to me several times.

42:16.310 --> 42:17.339
Young Master Guo,

42:17.359 --> 42:18.600
why is it that I smell something fishy

42:18.600 --> 42:20.260
whenever you talk to me?

42:20.280 --> 42:21.360
Fishy?

42:22.560 --> 42:24.150
But I've already taken a bath.

42:24.439 --> 42:25.959
Just shut up.

42:50.760 --> 42:53.479
My son, I'm here to visit you again.

42:57.399 --> 42:58.879
Did she get another son?

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.026 --> 44:39.486
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.906 --> 45:20.106
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
